<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>潮汐该如何拥抱篝火</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: "Songti SC", "SimSun", serif;
      display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh; overflow: hidden;
      background-color: #111;
      perspective: 1000px;
    }

    .app-container {
      width: 100vw; max-width: 480px; height: 100vh;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518837695005-2083093ee35b?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop');
      background-size: 120% 110%;
      background-position: center;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      will-change: background-position;
    }

    /* 涟漪特效 */
    .ripple {
      position: absolute; border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5), inset 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      transform: scale(0); pointer-events: none; z-index: 9999;
    }
    .ripple-main { animation: rippleEffectMain 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.1, 0.8, 0.3, 1) forwards; }
    .ripple-inner { animation: rippleEffectInner 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.1, 0.8, 0.3, 1) forwards; animation-delay: 0.05s; }
    @keyframes rippleEffectMain { 0% { transform: scale(0); opacity: 1; } 100% { transform: scale(2); opacity: 0; } }
    @keyframes rippleEffectInner { 0% { transform: scale(0); opacity: 0.8; } 100% { transform: scale(1.2); opacity: 0; } }

    /* 页面基础 */
    .page {
      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;
      transition: opacity 0.8s ease-in-out, visibility 0.8s ease-in-out;
    }
    .page.active { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; z-index: 10; }

    .center-content {
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    /* 标题和按钮锁定在中间 */
    .main-title { font-size: 23px; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
    .sub-title { font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #ccc; margin-bottom: 50px; text-align: center; }
    .question { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
    .story-text-small { font-size: 12px; color: #aaa; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 35px; line-height: 1.8; letter-spacing: 1px; }

    .btn {
      padding: 14px 40px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px;
      cursor: pointer; font-family: "Songti SC", serif; transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .btn:active { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); transform: scale(0.98); }

    /* ======= 第一页 超大透明星空字 ======= */
    .p1-name-left {
      position: absolute; top: 10%; left: 8%;
      font-size: 50px; font-family: "SimSun", "Songti SC", serif; font-weight: bold;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      text-shadow: 0 0 2px #fff, 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      will-change: transform;
    }
    .p1-name-right {
      position: absolute; top: 10%; right: 8%;
      font-size: 50px; font-family: "SimSun", "Songti SC", serif; font-weight: bold;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      text-shadow: 0 0 2px #fff, 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      will-change: transform;
    }

    /* 死死锁住位置的文案 */
    .p1-txt-top {
      position: absolute; top: 25%; left: 10%; width: 80%;
      font-size: 13px; color: #ddd; line-height: 2; letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-align: left; text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
      will-change: transform;
    }
    .p1-txt-bottom {
      position: absolute; bottom: 15%; right: 10%; width: 80%;
      font-size: 13px; color: #ddd; line-height: 2; letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-align: right; text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
      will-change: transform;
    }

    /* ======= 加载中页面 (绝对居中) ======= */
    #page-loading {
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
    }

    .loading-title {
      font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 4px; color: #fff; white-space: nowrap;
      text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
      animation: fadeInText 2s ease forwards;
      will-change: transform;
      margin: auto;
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%; left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }

    .scattered-text {
      position: absolute; font-size: 15px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65); letter-spacing: 1px;
      opacity: 0; text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      will-change: transform;
    }

    .txt-1 { top: 20%; left: 10%; animation: fadeInFloat 1.5s ease 0.5s forwards; }
    .txt-2 { top: 35%; right: 10%; animation: fadeInFloat 1.5s ease 1.0s forwards; }
    .txt-3 { bottom: 30%; left: 10%; animation: fadeInFloat 1.5s ease 1.5s forwards; }
    .txt-4 { bottom: 20%; right: 10%; animation: fadeInFloat 1.5s ease 2.0s forwards; }

    @keyframes fadeInFloat { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); } 100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
    @keyframes fadeInText { 0% { opacity: 0; } 100% { opacity: 1; } }

    /* 选项按钮 */
    .option-btn {
      width: 100%; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 15px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 15px;
      color: #ffffff; font-family: "Songti SC", serif; letter-spacing: 1px; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s;
    }
    .option-btn:active, .option-btn.selected {
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
      color: #ffffff; text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    }
    .result-text { font-size: 18px; margin: 20px 0 40px; text-align: center; line-height: 2; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #fff;}
    .tap-hint { font-size: 12px; color: #aaaaaa; letter-spacing: 1px; animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
    @keyframes pulse { 0% { opacity: 0.4; } 50% { opacity: 1; } 100% { opacity: 0.4; } }

    /* 资料档案页 */
    .profile-scroll-area {
      width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: hidden; padding-bottom: 60px;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }
    .profile-scroll-area::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

    .top-nav {
      position: sticky; top: 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-around;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      padding: 15px 10px; z-index: 100; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }
    .top-nav a { color: #ccc; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1px; transition: 0.3s; }
    .top-nav a:active { color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 8px #fff; }

    .hero-section { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 40px 20px 20px; position: relative; }

    .status-wrapper { position: relative; margin-bottom: 15px; z-index: 50; will-change: transform;}
    .status-btn {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      color: #fff; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 1px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      cursor: pointer; font-family: "Songti SC", serif;
    }
    .status-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ff4d4f; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ff4d4f; transition: 0.3s;}

    .status-menu {
      position: absolute; top: 35px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.9); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 6px;
      width: 100px; display: none; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    .status-menu.show { display: flex; }
    .status-menu div { padding: 10px; font-size: 12px; color: #ccc; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); cursor: pointer; }
    .status-menu div:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .status-menu div:active { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: #fff; }

    .avatar-container {
      width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); padding: 4px; margin-bottom: 25px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 15px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4); will-change: transform;
    }
    .avatar-img { width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; background-color: #1a1a1a; }

    .profile-name { font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 4px; margin-bottom: 25px; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.4); will-change: transform;}
    .tags-container { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; max-width: 340px; margin: 0 auto 25px; will-change: transform;}
    .tag { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); padding: 6px 16px; font-size: 13px; color: #ddd; letter-spacing: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }

    .info-card {
      margin: 0 20px 25px; background: rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.65);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 8px; padding: 25px; backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
      will-change: transform;
    }
    .card-title { font-size: 15px; color: #e0e0e0; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
    .style-item { margin-bottom: 15px; }
    .style-label { font-size: 13px; color: #d9d9d9; letter-spacing: 1px; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .style-value { font-size: 14px; color: #f5f5f5; line-height: 1.8; }
    .style-divider { height: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); margin: 12px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-container">
    <section id="page-loading" class="page active">
      <div class="center-content">
        <div class="loading-title">潮汐该如何拥抱篝火</div>
        <div class="scattered-text txt-1">星光静候</div>
        <div class="scattered-text txt-2">沉默的回响</div>
        <div class="scattered-text txt-3">温度与距离</div>
        <div class="scattered-text txt-4">你与我之间</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page" id="page-intro">
      <div class="center-content">
        <div class="main-title">潮汐该如何拥抱篝火</div>
        <div class="sub-title">一个关于温度与距离的故事</div>
        <div class="question">如果你要做出选择，你会：</div>
        <div class="story-text-small">向海靠近，或是站在岸边看月光。</div>
        <button class="btn" data-target="page-profile">继续</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page" id="page-profile">
      <div class="profile-scroll-area">
        <nav class="top-nav">
          <a href="#overview">概览</a>
          <a href="#style">风格</a>
          <a href="#contact">联系</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="hero-section">
          <div class="status-wrapper">
            <button class="status-btn" type="button">
              <span class="status-dot"></span>
              <span>在线</span>
            </button>
            <div class="status-menu">
              <div>在线</div>
              <div>忙碌</div>
              <div>离线</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="avatar-container">
            <img class="avatar-img" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&q=80" alt="avatar">
          </div>

          <h1 class="profile-name">山岚</h1>

          <div class="tags-container">
            <span class="tag">摄影</span>
            <span class="tag">旅行</span>
            <span class="tag">书写</span>
            <span class="tag">孤独</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card" id="overview">
          <div class="card-title">ABOUT</div>
          <div class="style-item">
            <span class="style-label">简介</span>
            <div class="style-value">喜欢在雨后看云，记录每一处灯火微凉的日子，也在黑夜里学着把回忆变成温柔。</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card" id="style">
          <div class="card-title">STYLE</div>
          <div class="style-item">
            <span class="style-label">审美</span>
            <div class="style-value">偏爱含蓄、克制与不显眼的温暖，倾向于把情绪藏在细节里。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="style-divider"></div>
          <div class="style-item">
            <span class="style-label">日常</span>
            <div class="style-value">走路慢一点，听风声，喝温水，看天色变化，像在等某种潮汐归来。</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card" id="contact">
          <div class="card-title">CONTACT</div>
          <div class="style-item">
            <span class="style-label">邮箱</span>
            <div class="style-value">example@domain.com</div>
          </div>
          <div class="style-item">
            <span class="style-label">城市</span>
            <div class="style-value">海边，安静而适合长时间思考</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
      const pages = document.querySelectorAll('.page');
      const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('[data-target]');

      buttons.forEach(function (button) {
        button.addEventListener('click', function () {
          const targetId = button.getAttribute('data-target');
          const targetPage = document.getElementById(targetId);
          if (!targetPage) return;

          pages.forEach(function (page) {
            page.classList.remove('active');
          });

          targetPage.classList.add('active');
        });
      });

      const statusBtn = document.querySelector('.status-btn');
      const statusMenu = document.querySelector('.status-menu');
      if (statusBtn && statusMenu) {
        statusBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
          statusMenu.classList.toggle('show');
        });
      }
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
